# "If you sacrificed a creature this way": Bot1 controls no creature when it uses the -2, so it sacrifices nothing and gets no
# Beast, while Bot2's only creature, an Elvish Mystic, is still sacrificed - and exiled instead of dying. (The control is
# garruk-veiled-butcher-minus-two-each-player-sacrifices-and-an-opponents-creature-is-exiled.) Loyalty 5 - 2 = 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Garruk, Veiled Butcher
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x20

